msgstr "왕실에 납치되었다"

msgctxt "woh_chal:106"
msgid "Congratulations! You've survived!"
msgstr "축하한다! 당신은 살아남았다!"

msgctxt "woh_chal:107"
msgid "You're taking a break!"
msgstr "당신은 휴식을 취한다!"

msgctxt "woh_chal:108"
msgid "The horror is over... for now."
msgstr "공포는 끝났다... 일단은."

msgctxt "woh_chal:109"
msgid "You've perished!"
msgstr "당신은 사망했다!"

msgctxt "woh_chal:110"
msgid "Moved to KAIBARA"
msgstr "카이바라로 이사했다"

msgctxt "woh_chal:111"
msgid "REWARDS FOR SOLVING THIS MYSTERY"
msgstr "미스터리 해결 시 얻는 보상"

