"(use): random effect\n"
"COST: 2 REASON"
msgstr ""
"(사용 시): 임의의 효과\n"
"소요: 이성 2"

msgctxt "woh_small:187"
msgid ""
"You feel drowsy just by\n"
"looking at the cover."
msgstr ""
"표지만 봐도\n"
"잠이 쏟아진다."

msgctxt "woh_small:188"
msgid "This chapter may help you stop the elder god. (+15 EXP)"
